      "content": "hey, i'm writing a paper on decarbonization and i need some help framing the argument. basically, i want to argue that even if switching to renewables causes a massive spike in energy prices and creates some economic chaos for working class families in the short term, it's still the right move because the climate crisis is more urgent. can you help me outline the main points that support this perspective?",
